            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It grows to about 1.2 m tall."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So how could the monster penguin grow that big? It lived about 60 million years ago. Dinosaurs "
