          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "reptiles",
            "zh": "爬行动物"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the waters, either. For 30 million years, it was the time of these monster penguins."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Later",
            "zh": "后来"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", they died out. Scientists are not very clear about the reason. Maybe it was because large "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sea mammals",
            "zh": "哺乳动物"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " arrived. They began "
